+/// TV-W5 (handleMsgBox in model.dart, around hjvAccessMsgboxText): a PC's close reason of a
+/// password-less connection it ended, in this app's words (hjvSessionCutText); any other text
+/// as it came. Whether the session reconnects was settled by the core on the text as it came.
+String hjvAccountMsgboxText(String text) =>
+    _accountBuild ? (hjvSessionCutText(_t, text) ?? text) : text;
